tehouse and hounded every step of the way by the press can Dennis keep it together and make the game happen Or will it all go up in a mushroom cloud of smoke', 'duration': 5956, 'media_type': 'movie', 'tmdb_id': 'dennis rodmans big bang in pyongyang_2015', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '327031', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Medicine of the Wolf', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge02.tubitv.com/P6wEkFd-OjDayrPb0_-cyPsb_ic=/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/4b8a5f10-c4d9-4ad4-81a1-9a95e24edd88.jpg', 'year': 2015, 'genre': ['Independent', 'Documentary'], 'plot': 'Year: 2015\nDuration: 74 mins\nPlot: To look into the eyes of the Wolf is to see your own soul once proclaimed American Author and Scientist Aldo Leopold In this beautiful and important documentary filmmaker Julia Huffman travels to Minnesota and into wolf country to pursue the deep intrinsic value of perhaps the most unjustly maligned animal on the face of the planet Medicine of the Wolf focusses on these extraordinary sentient creatures and the remarkable worldrenowned National Geographic photographer Jim Brandenburg who has photographed and studied wolves for 45 years—longer than anyone in history As our guide Brandenburg enables us to see the world of the wolf as we have never seen it before Documented with stunning cinematography of the Northern Minnesota landscape wolf country” Medicine of the Wolf tugs at the emotions while presenting the complexities and highly charged politics now surrounding an animal being pushed towards extinction', 'duration': 4490, 'media_type': 'movie', 'tmdb_id': 'medicine of the wolf_2015', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '341524', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Loves Her Gun', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge.tubitv.com/8Dfgo4MFltAs-XWaTfFBBKrePsI=/37x0:1157x1600/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/ffd74b02-4240-42ce-8203-3806cdc2f97b.jpg', 'year': 2014, 'genre': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Independent'], 'plot': 'Year: 2014\nDuration: 99 mins\nPlot: Allie leads an unfocused life with no job and a lame boyfriend So its no surprise when she hops on an RV full of karate rockers headed to Texas after she is attacked on the streets of New York Seeming to improve as she settles into the slower pace of Austin her fears continue to haunt her She quickly falls into Texas gun culture as a means to feel safe She walks the fine line between reasonable selfpreservation and paranoid withdrawal Can she maintain healthy relationships or will the weapons she uses to protect herself cause her problems worse that the ones she was fleeing', 'duration': 5963, 'media_type': 'movie', 'tmdb_id': 'loves her gun_2014', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '385363', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Barney Thomson', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge02.tubitv.com/VEBT92KJDVJYsNSSLUPeRNLUWG0=/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/865bbd73-10c5-407f-ae59-8907e9bf0800.jpg', 'year': 2015, 'genre': ['Crime', 'Comedy', 'Independent'], 'plot': 'Year: 2015\nDuration: 96 mins\nPlot: An awkward diffident Glasgow barber lives a life of desperate mediocrity until he enters the grotesque and comically absurd world of the serial killer', 'duration': 5762, 'media_type': 'movie', 'tmdb_id': 'barney thomson_2015', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '394492', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Ghost World', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge.tubitv.com/2jJYijlJz5OJXqtuZmrLKFKLGdw=/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/f8ee0b3d-243d-4d26-80b5-4b28f4c5673c.jpg', 'year': 2000, 'genre': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Independent'], 'plot': 'Year: 2000\nDuration: 111 mins\nPlot: Based on the wellknown comic  two high school students taking a hard look at the world they wryly observe and decide what they really want altering their friendship forever', 'duration': 6686, 'media_type': 'movie', 'tmdb_id': 'ghost world_2000', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '414114', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'The Age of Consequences', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge.tubitv.com/tATtfHYeS-VOUT_B3NBEn0SdkIw=/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/43436470-8aec-4ec8-b5cb-018206fe5668.jpg', 'year': 2017, 'genre': ['Independent', 'Documentary'], 'p